
@startuml Reservation State Diagram

title Reservation - State Diagram

hide empty description

state "PENDING" as Pending
state "RESERVED" as Reserved

[*] --> Pending : Create reservation

Pending --> Reserved : Payment successful
Pending --> Pending : Payment failed

Pending --> [*] : Cancel reservation
Pending --> [*] : Reservation expired

Reserved --> [*] : Cancel reservation

note right of Pending
    Reservation is valid for 5 minutes.
    Seats are temporarily blocked.
end note

note right of Reserved
    Payment completed.
    Seats are reserved.
end note

note bottom of Reserved
    Cancellation is possible only
    if the reservation can be cancelled.
end note

@enduml
